            "is_free": false,
            "detailed_description": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/666020/extras/a7b4588bed97539831d3d177bb3eb8fc.avif?t=1636727991\" width=400 height=280 /></span><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/666020/extras/9f8d214a5cd4df25d128dc4125fd0b90.webp?t=1636727991\" width=285 height=50 /></span><br>As a unique detective who operates mostly underwater, can you solve the array of baffling cases brought to you by eccentric clients? And even if you can, can you score with a shark girl along the way? The answer is; yeah, probably.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/666020/extras/eafb874fd3efd6dd2481591fad39dc67.webp?t=1636727991\" width=285 height=50 /></span><br>Shark Dating Simulator XL is a quirky visual novel packed with irreverent and immature humour featuring short-play stories with a host of remarkable characters. Well, it will be. It's got one story right now, but I'm aiming for another one ready for November and finally we can leave early access!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/666020/extras/63b1107e7abe5a3ed5c9aac5c9d07744.webp?t=1636727991\" width=285 height=50 /></span><br>~ A visual novel unlike any other.<br>~ Vibrant cartoon graphics. I have two degrees in this stuff, believe it or not.<br>~ Kawaii Shark Girl desu Senpai!",
            "about_the_game": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/666020/extras/a7b4588bed97539831d3d177bb3eb8fc.avif?t=1636727991\" width=400 height=280 /></span><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/666020/extras/9f8d214a5cd4df25d128dc4125fd0b90.webp?t=1636727991\" width=285 height=50 /></span><br>As a unique detective who operates mostly underwater, can you solve the array of baffling cases brought to you by eccentric clients? And even if you can, can you score with a shark girl along the way? The answer is; yeah, probably.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/666020/extras/eafb874fd3efd6dd2481591fad39dc67.webp?t=1636727991\" width=285 height=50 /></span><br>Shark Dating Simulator XL is a quirky visual novel packed with irreverent and immature humour featuring short-play stories with a host of remarkable characters. Well, it will be. It's got one story right now, but I'm aiming for another one ready for November and finally we can leave early access!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/666020/extras/63b1107e7abe5a3ed5c9aac5c9d07744.webp?t=1636727991\" width=285 height=50 /></span><br>~ A visual novel unlike any other.<br>~ Vibrant cartoon graphics. I have two degrees in this stuff, believe it or not.<br>~ Kawaii Shark Girl desu Senpai!",
